<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LanguageData>

  <!-- EN: Companion Attack Drone pack -->
  <DNX_Apparel_SynchronizedGunDroneHarness.label>伴飞攻击无人机背包</DNX_Apparel_SynchronizedGunDroneHarness.label>
  <!-- EN: A squad-portable cooperative attack drone system. Once deployed, it follows its operator in flight and coordinates its attacks according to their movement, line of sight, and tactical orders. Its weapon is far from enough to decide a battle on its own, but a second firing angle, sustained suppression, and immediate reconnaissance are enough to make any enemy behind cover reconsider their position. -->
  <DNX_Apparel_SynchronizedGunDroneHarness.description>一种可由单兵携行的协同攻击无人机。部署后，它会始终伴随操作员飞行，根据其动作、视线和战术指令协同作战。虽然它搭载的武器远不足以改变战局，但第二个射击角度、持续压制以及即时侦察能力，足以让任何掩体后的敌人重新思考自己的位置。</DNX_Apparel_SynchronizedGunDroneHarness.description>
  <!-- EN: Companion Attack Drone -->
  <DNX_SynchronizedGunDrone.label>伴飞攻击无人机</DNX_SynchronizedGunDrone.label>
  <!-- EN: A compact cooperative attack drone carried by an infantry operator. It can hold formation beside its host or sortie to a commanded position, adding a second firing angle and immediate reconnaissance. -->
  <DNX_SynchronizedGunDrone.description>一种由单兵携行的紧凑型协同攻击无人机。它可以伴随宿主保持编队，也可以飞向指定位置出击，为战斗增加第二个射击角度和即时侦察能力。</DNX_SynchronizedGunDrone.description>
  <!-- EN: companion drone light machine gun -->
  <DNX_Gun_SynchronizedDroneLMG.label>伴飞无人机轻机枪</DNX_Gun_SynchronizedDroneLMG.label>
  <!-- EN: A very compact light machine gun carried by a Companion Attack Drone. -->
  <DNX_Gun_SynchronizedDroneLMG.description>安装在伴飞攻击无人机上的超小型轻机枪。</DNX_Gun_SynchronizedDroneLMG.description>

</LanguageData>
